# Pathfinder - Cursor Rules

## Project Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- Prisma ORM with SQLite (dev)
- NextAuth for authentication
- Tailwind CSS
- Groq API for AI (GROQ_API_KEY in .env)

## After Every Change
- Always run: npx tsc --noEmit
- Always list which files were changed
- Always summarise what was changed and why
- Always confirm if mock data toggle still works

## Never Touch Without Asking
- Any file in src/app/api/auth/
- Any NextAuth configuration
- prisma/schema.prisma (ask first, then change)
- Any existing API route (extend, never replace)
- The BRANCHES array angles (ask first)
- Authentication session logic

## Code Style
- Use DM Sans for all UI text
- Use Cormorant Garamond for display/heading text
- Dark background is always #040A14
- Never hardcode colours - use branch.color
- Never use !important in CSS
- Prefer CSS transitions over JS animations
- Keep components under 300 lines - split if larger

## Before Any Big Change
- Check if change affects mock data toggle
- Check if change affects mobile layout
- Check feature flags before adding new UI
- Run git checkpoint before destructive changes

## Architecture Rules
- Life map nodes always go through transformGoals() before rendering
- New features must have a feature flag in src/lib/flags.ts before being built
- Never fetch data inside SVG rendering logic
- Keep AI API calls in /api routes only - never call AI from client components directly

## Key File Locations (updated)
- Branch config: src/data/branches.ts
- Feature flags: src/config/flags.ts
- Map geometry: src/utils/geometry.ts
- Mock data: src/data/mock-data.ts
- Main map screen: src/screens/LifeMap.tsx
- Guided flow: src/components/guided-flow/
- Map components: src/components/map/

## When asked to change branch layout
Always edit src/utils/geometry.ts and
src/data/branches.ts — never hardcode
positions in component files.

## When asked to add a feature
Always add to src/config/flags.ts first
set to false, then build it, then set to true.

## Naming Conventions
- Components: PascalCase
- API routes: kebab-case
- Utility functions: camelCase
- Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- Branch ids: lowercase no spaces

## Testing
- Mock data lives in src/data/mock-data.ts
- Toggle with NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_MOCK_DATA=true
- Test accounts defined in prisma/seed.ts
- Always test with mock data before real data
